   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1044,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7311,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "rcu_read_lock() 只改本 CPU / 本任务的计数，甚至什么都不做\n→ 读者之间完全不互相干扰，读侧随 CPU 数线性扩展",
   "originalText": "rcu_read_lock() 只改本 CPU / 本任务的计数，甚至什么都不做\n→ 读者之间完全不互相干扰，读侧随 CPU 数线性扩展",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "AU2MWU4j",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 516,
   "width": 960.0,
   "height": 18.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0045",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1045,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7318,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "代价转移给写者：不能原地修改，只能\"复制 → 修改 → 发布新版本\"，还要等旧读者都走完才能释放旧版本。RCU 的全部复杂性都在这一侧。",
   "originalText": "代价转移给写者：不能原地修改，只能\"复制 → 修改 → 发布新版本\"，还要等旧读者都走完才能释放旧版本。RCU 的全部复杂性都在这一侧。",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "gIdcRvPu",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 580,
   "width": 920.4000000000001,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0046",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1046,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7325,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "② 核心思想：多版本（MVCC）—— 发布新版本，等旧读者都走完，再回收旧版本",
   "originalText": "② 核心思想：多版本（MVCC）—— 发布新版本，等旧读者都走完，再回收旧版本",
