   "text": "synchronize_rcu() 阻塞等一个 GP；\ncall_rcu() / kfree_rcu() 登记回调，GP 后异步执行",
   "originalText": "synchronize_rcu() 阻塞等一个 GP；\ncall_rcu() / kfree_rcu() 登记回调，GP 后异步执行",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
