   "index": "a0109",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7766,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "classic RCU 的读侧临界区里不能睡眠 —— 原因见 ④ 的 QS 定义",
   "originalText": "classic RCU 的读侧临界区里不能睡眠 —— 原因见 ④ 的 QS 定义",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "9J5buhe2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1356,
   "width": 769.6000000000001,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0110",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1110,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7773,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "④ QS 与 GP：不跟踪每个读者，而是等每个 CPU 都经过一次 QS",
   "originalText": "④ QS 与 GP：不跟踪每个读者，而是等每个 CPU 都经过一次 QS",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "jv3RovbW",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1398,
   "width": 987.0,
   "height": 37.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0111",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1111,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7780,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "QS（静止态）= 这个 CPU 此刻一定不在读侧临界区里。GP 开始后，只要每个 CPU 都经过了一次 QS，GP 开始前就进入的读者就一定都结束了。\n读侧之所以不能睡眠：上下文切换被当作 QS，读者睡下去会让 RCU 误以为它已经离开临界区。",
   "originalText": "QS（静止态）= 这个 CPU 此刻一定不在读侧临界区里。GP 开始后，只要每个 CPU 都经过了一次 QS，GP 开始前就进入的读者就一定都结束了。\n读侧之所以不能睡眠：上下文切换被当作 QS，读者睡下去会让 RCU 误以为它已经离开临界区。",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
